1.8.16: Retries are bounded and jittered. Every entry is validated before it is written. The service keeps its state in an append-only journal and rebuilds the index on start.

3.8.3: Keys are compared case-sensitively. Every entry is validated before it is written. The default is deliberately conservative.

1.12.12: Operators should not edit generated files by hand. Unknown keys are ignored with a warning. The default is deliberately conservative.

0.3.6: The service keeps its state in an append-only journal and rebuilds the index on start. Unknown keys are ignored with a warning. This section is kept for historical reasons and may be removed in a later revision.

2.10.3: Unknown keys are ignored with a warning. Keys are compared case-sensitively. See the runbook for the rollout procedure.

2.7.3: See the runbook for the rollout procedure. This section is kept for historical reasons and may be removed in a later revision. The default is deliberately conservative.
